"Petition for Approval of Compromise of Claim or Action or Disposition of Proceeds of Judgment for Minor or Person With A Disability | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/MC-350)\nciteturn1698search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # Petition for Approval of Compromise of Claim or Action or Disposition of Proceeds of Judgment for Minor or Person With A Disability (MC-350)If you are acting on behalf of a minor (a person under 18 years old) or a person with a disability about a court case or other claim for money for that person, ask the court to approve any settlement of that case or claim.\n\n# Petition for Approval of Compromise of Claim or Action or Disposition of Proceeds of Judgment for Minor or Person With A Disability (MC-350)\n\nIf you are acting on behalf of a minor (a person under 18 years old) or a person with a disability about a court case or other claim for money for that person, ask the court to approve any settlement of that case or claim. Also ask the court to approve how money the court orders to be paid to the minor or person with a disability will be used.\n\nGet form MC-350\n\nEffective: January 1, 2021--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMC-350 PETITION FOR APPROVAL OF COMPROMISE OF CLAIM OR ACTION OR DISPOSITION OF PROCEEDS OF JUDGMENT FOR MINOR OR PERSON WITH A DISABILITY (https://courts.ca.gov/sites/default/files/courts/default/2024-11/mc350.pdf)\nciteturn1698search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.8 years ago; Crawled: 5.7 years ago; MC-350 ... Total amount of attorney's fees for which court approval is requested:  $\nMC-350\n\nCASE NAME: ________________________________  CASE NUMBER: ________________________________\n\n12. **Claimant's medical expenses** (continued)\n\nb. (5) (b) The name of each medical service provider that furnished care and treatment to claimant and (1) has a lien for all or any part of the charges or (2) was paid (or will be paid fr